flowchart TD
  Timer[Feed worker poll] --> API[Read enabled feeds and cursor]
  API --> Events[Fetch activity and rank events]
  Events --> Render[Build Discord components and attachments]
  Render --> Send[Send or update Discord message]
  Send -->|success| Cursor[Advance durable cursor or delivery state]
  Send -->|failure| Retry[Keep event available for later delivery]
  Cursor --> Timer
  Retry --> Timer
